  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Plural prepositional",
   "texto": [
    "In all genres, the plural prepositional is formed from the plural nominative. After a hard base **-ах** is used; after a soft base, **-ях**: **школы → в школах**, **книги → о книгах**, **друзья → о друзьях**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Adjectives in plural",
   "texto": [
    "The adjective matches the noun in number and case, but it carries its own termination. In the plural prepositional **-ых** is used as a basic form and **-их** after soft consonant or consonant of the orthographic rule (**г, к, х, ж, ч, ш, щ**): **новый → новых**, **большой → больших**, **хороший → хороших**. The noun retains its plural termination **-ах/-ях**."
   ]
  },
